---
title: Admin cập nhật “sản phẩm” = extension
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as Admin browser
    participant A1 as Pre-actions
    participant A2 as MarketplaceExtension
    participant A3 as ModelMarketplaceExtension
    participant A4 as DB
    A0->>A1: POST marketplace/extension/edit + user_token
    A1->>A2: login + access gate → edit()
    A2->>A2: load language/model → validateForm() [modify]
    A2->>A3: editExtension(extension_id,post)
    A3->>A4: UPDATE extension; DELETE/INSERT extension_image
    A3->>A4: SELECT old downloads; DELETE paths/downloads; INSERT new rows
    A2->>A0: session success → redirect list
